> heh, which usage of "that"?

The conjunction that introduces a subordinate clause.

> "that apple over there",

That one is {va}/{vu}.

>"I am the man that ate the apple",

That one is {poi ke'a}.

> "that which does not kill me will only make me stronger"....

That one would be {lo}.

There's also "that's beautiful", which would be {ta}/{tu}.

